  unitName: Spring Flower Piany
  unitId: 20704
  unitNumber: 1179
  description: A fairy whose form changed into a flower. Originally, fairies like
    Piany were very common and abundant in Grand Gaia. However, most of them were
    turned into flowers as they absorbed the power of demon crystals in order to
    help the disease ridden Vriksha Duchy. These miraculous flowers saved many people,
    but the terrible power from the demon crystals remained trapped within the flowers
    that had been left intact. Piany then began changing from a sweet fairy into
    a demon under the influence of this malevolent power.
  summonDesc: You want to me to help you?<br>I guess I could...<br>You're a good
    person though, right?
  fusionDesc: Stop it!<br>If I gain any more power, I...<br>I'll lose myself completely...
